{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And he shall dismantle the house.</b> In the command [voice]. And likewise \"and he shall bring out\" and \"that which is near,\" which is closed, shall be seven days — only the verse held to a concise path. The witness: \"and the one who enters the house all the days of its closing,\" in the first [week] and in the second."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:13.297815354Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}